# 🚀 Day 60: Graduation Day – Shipping ActionFlow v1.0.0 🎓

## 🎉 AB Talks 60-Day Claude AI Challenge Completed!

After **60 days of continuous learning** and a **10-day AI Capstone Sprint**, I'm proud to announce the completion and release of **ActionFlow v1.0.0** — my first production-ready AI-powered web application.

## 🌟 Project: ActionFlow

**ActionFlow** is an AI-powered meeting assistant that transforms messy meeting notes into structured summaries and actionable tasks, helping users stay organized across all their meetings.

## ✨ Features

* 🤖 AI-powered meeting summarization
* ✅ Automatic action item extraction
* 📊 Unified dashboard for meetings & tasks
* 🔍 Search past meetings
* 🔐 Secure authentication with Supabase
* 📡 Offline detection
* ♿ Accessibility improvements
* 🚀 Production deployment on Vercel

## 🛠 Tech Stack

* Next.js (App Router)
* TypeScript
* Tailwind CSS
* Supabase
* PostgreSQL
* Groq API (Llama 3.3 70B)
* Vercel

